 "source_instruction": "i would like a peach juice that is non gmo and gluten free.",
 "query": "You know I spent almost two hours yesterday rearranging all the potted herbs on my tiny apartment fire escape? I\u2019d been meaning to do it for weeks, ever since that random wind gust knocked my basil plant straight into the neighbor\u2019s fire escape last month and they left a very passive aggressive sticky note about \u201cunauthorized plant debris\u201d taped to my railing. I picked up those little terracotta saucers to catch water drips, moved the mint a little further out so it gets more afternoon sun, and even strung those tiny warm white fairy lights between the railings so it feels like a little cozy nook when I sit out there after work. I even tested sitting on my wobbly old folding stool out there for ten minutes last night to make sure nothing was going to tip over, and it was so nice listening to the neighborhood kids chase each other down the sidewalk while the smell of someone\u2019s backyard barbecue drifted up. Hey, can you help me find some good gluten-free drinks from the beverage section? I\u2019ve been really into sparkling lemonade lately since my cousin brought over a case that had those cute reusable metal straws bundled with it last weekend, so I\u2019d love ones that come with those same reusable metal straws included too. My budget\u2019s pretty reasonable for what I\u2019m looking for, I don\u2019t want to go overboard on spending. Let me know what options you\u2019ve got that fit what I\u2019m after!",
